  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.11,
      "e": 7.19,
      "text": "- [Jonathan] Tsunamis are destructive forces of nature"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.19,
      "e": 9.56,
      "text": "that can threaten your personal safety."
    },
    {
      "s": 9.56,
      "e": 11.06,
      "text": "- Orient yourself."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.37,
      "e": 12.33,
      "text": "Find high ground."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.33,
      "e": 13.58,
      "text": "Find a shelter."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.88,
      "e": 16.96,
      "text": "You wanna also see the things around you"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.96,
      "e": 19.15,
      "text": "if there's a shelter nearby."
    },
    {
      "s": 19.15,
      "e": 21.44,
      "text": "And then you're gonna wanna begin to evacuate."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.44,
      "e": 23.56,
      "text": "If you have family that are here with you,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.56,
      "e": 26.05,
      "text": "have a predesignated rally spot."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.05,
      "e": 27.28,
      "text": "And once you get there,"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.28,
      "e": 29.25,
      "text": "send an SMS message or a text message"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.25,
      "e": 30.54,
      "text": "to people you are accountable to or for"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.54,
      "e": 31.38,
      "text": "(phone dings)"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.38,
      "e": 33.11,
      "text": "so they know where you are."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.11,
      "e": 34.74,
      "text": "- [Jonathan] There are simple steps to take"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.74,
      "e": 37.23,
      "text": "to make sure you stay safe during a tsunami."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.23,
      "e": 38.34,
      "text": "- Don't go to the shore."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.34,
      "e": 42.14,
      "text": "Identify where you can and can't go to be safe."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.14,
      "e": 44.06,
      "text": "If you can have a plan,"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.12,
      "e": 47.28,
      "text": "also have an evacuation kit available."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.63,
      "e": 50.18,
      "text": "- [Jonathan] Your evacuation kit should include food,"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.18,
      "e": 53.2,
      "text": "water, a way to charge your cell phone, clothes,"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.2,
      "e": 56.2,
      "text": "and toiletries to last you 72 hours."
    },
    {
      "s": 56.37,
      "e": 58.17,
      "text": "Reporting from Okinawa, Japan,"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.17,
      "e": 61.17,
      "text": "I'm Lance Corporal Jonathan Pearson."
    }
  ],
